e="CompoundParametersType"></parameter><outcome id="132" followingActionId="-1" terminatorId="2"/><outcome id="131" followingActionId="179" terminatorId="1"/><outcome id="133" followingActionId="-1" terminatorId="3"/><terminators><terminator id="1" index="0" acronym="End" name="End"/><terminator id="2" index="1" acronym="Err" name="Error"/><terminator id="3" index="2" acronym="SE" name="SystemError"/></terminators><caching/></action><action xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:type="compoundAction" id="43" name="A_NL_DeconfigureSystem" description="FR1 SA Initial Registration.
===========================
Signalling scenario for 5G NR SA - Initial registration:-
UE Attach, Initial registration and PDU session establishment.

-&gt; Broadcast NR cell for UE cell selection (MIB, SIB1) on FR1 band
-&gt; Random Access procedure for RRC connection establishment
-&gt; AS security procedures
-&gt; Configure Data Radio Bearer
-&gt; Registration with primary authentication (no 5G security context)

Basic Cell Configuration:
------------------------
FR1 - 3GHz - n78
System Bandwidth 100MHz
Sub-Carrier spacing 30kHz
nARFCN = 626976
