Raise NR Cell1 Power above threshold

]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="64" anchorIdType="1"><w x="90" y="590"/><w x="170" y="592"/></NoteLink></Note><Note x="193" y="98" width="541" height="46"><Text><![CDATA[The Compound Procedure performs the LTE NR and NR NR Measurements:
