]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="84" anchorIdType="1"><w x="796" y="-415"/><w x="719" y="-415"/></NoteLink></Note><Note x="9" y="-725" width="844" height="38"><Text><![CDATA[The compound procedure performs "LTE Authentication procedure" based on Authentication parameters provided by user.  In case of a Authentication failure due to "Synch Failure" re authentication is performed.]]></Text></Note><Note x="1121" y="347" width="472" height="75"><Text><![CDATA[If Authentication failure is because of synch failure then set the variable "isSyncFailure" to True and
restart authentication procedure. 

]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="56" anchorIdType="1"><w x="1106" y="385"/><w x="916" y="382"/></NoteLink></Note><Note x="48" y="-570" width="221" height="38"><Text><![CDATA[If Authentication is because of sync failure?]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="53" anchorIdType="1"><w x="284" y="-551"/><w x="348" y="-551"/></NoteLink></Note><Note x="305" y="-810" width="244" height="49"><Text><![CDATA[L_Library v0.0.0]]></Text></Note></layoutInformation></displayInformation><parameter xsi:type="CompoundParametersType"><ParameterAssignment xsi:type="ParameterAssignmentType"><ParameterName readOnly="true" xsi:type="VariableNameView">p_A_L_AuthenticationRequest_Message</ParameterName><ParameterValue default_able="true" variable_able="true" xsi:type="AuthenticationRequestMsg_autogen.type" variable_substituted="p_A_L_AuthenticationRequest_Message"><defaultValue><AuthenticationRequest xsi:type="AuthenticationRequest_RtdParameter.type"><Message><variable->p_A_L_AuthenticationRequest_Message</variable-></Message></AuthenticationRequest></defaultValue><nodePath>AuthenticationRequest/Message</nodePath><procedureLibrary>LteL3Lib</procedureLibrary></ParameterValue></ParameterAssignment></parameter><outcome id="165" followingActionId="52" terminatorId="1"/><outcome id="166" followingActionId="11" terminatorId="2"/><outcome id="167" followingActionId="12" terminatorId="3"/><terminators><terminator id="1" index="0" acronym="End" name="End"/><terminator id="2" index="1" acronym="Err" name="Error"/><terminator id="3" index="2" acronym="SE" name="SystemError"/></terminators><caching/></action><action xsi:type="compoundAction" id="52" name="A_L_EMMSecurityMode" description="FR1 SA Initial Registration.
===========================
Signalling scenario for 5G NR SA - Initial registration:-
UE Attach, Initial registration and PDU session establishment.

-&gt; Broadcast NR cell for UE cell selection (MIB, SIB1) on FR1 band
-&gt; Random Access procedure for RRC connection establishment
-&gt; AS security procedures
-&gt; Configure Data Radio Bearer
-&gt; Registration with primary authentication (no 5G security context)

Basic Cell Configuration:
------------------------
FR1 - 3GHz - n78
System Bandwidth 100MHz
Sub-Carrier spacing 30kHz
nARFCN = 626976
