]]></Text></Note><Note x="500" y="-595" width="119" height="38"><Text><![CDATA[L_Library v0.0.0]]></Text></Note><Note x="24" y="884" width="322" height="49"><Text><![CDATA[Execution of the ESM Information Request Procedure is dependant on the eit_Flag value received in the PDN Connectivity Request]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="26" anchorIdType="1"><w x="361" y="909"/><w x="469" y="907"/></NoteLink></Note><Note x="13" y="1340" width="212" height="88"><Text><![CDATA[This compound procedure builds an
Attach Accept EMM message. If applicable the appropriate EMM cause is inserted into the message.]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="109" anchorIdType="1"><w x="240" y="1384"/><w x="474" y="1377"/></NoteLink></Note><Note x="-148" y="-176" width="98" height="2010"><Text><![CDATA[Step 1a:

Switch on UE.

Wait for UE to
complete LTE
attach procedure.

As part of LTE
attach UE
successfully 
performs

NAS Authentication
NAS Security
RRC Security

A default eps
bearer is also
established during
LTE attach.]]></Text></Note><Note x="28" y="699" width="317" height="49"><Text><![CDATA[
Match incoming message "UE capability Information"
with support of EN-DC flag and Frequency Bands 
]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="98" anchorIdType="1"><w x="360" y="724"/><w x="455" y="722"/></NoteLink></Note><Note x="15" y="1210" width="217" height="88"><Text><![CDATA[This compound procedure builds an
Activate Default EPS Bearer Context Request ESM message. 
Supports: IPv4, IPv6, IPv4v6]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="86" anchorIdType="1"><w x="247" y="1254"/><w x="430" y="1255"/></NoteLink></Note><Note x="-150" y="1876" width="95" height="61"><Text><![CDATA[UE is now
Attached and 
Default EPS Bearer 
