===========================
Signalling scenario for 5G NR SA - Initial registration:-
UE Attach, Initial registration and PDU session establishment.

-&gt; Broadcast NR cell for UE cell selection (MIB, SIB1) on FR1 band
-&gt; Random Access procedure for RRC connection establishment
-&gt; AS security procedures
-&gt; Configure Data Radio Bearer
-&gt; Registration with primary authentication (no 5G security context)

Basic Cell Configuration:
------------------------
FR1 - 3GHz - n78
System Bandwidth 100MHz
Sub-Carrier spacing 30kHz
nARFCN = 626976
