1.LTE Attach on PDN1 .
2.IMS Registration on PDN2 over IPv4/IPv6 with IPSEC ON (PDN Type and IPSEC configurable).                     
3.Make a MT voice call over IMS successfully.                                4.Terminate the MT call and release allocated resources gracefully.
