e"><w x="-1964" y="607"/><w x="-1964" y="617"/><w x="-1964" y="617"/><w x="-1965" y="617"/><w x="-1965" y="617"/><w x="-1965" y="617"/><w x="-1965" y="645"/><w x="-1965" y="655"/></l><l o="49" a="34" s="false"><w x="-2131" y="979"/><w x="-2131" y="989"/><w x="-2131" y="989"/><w x="-2126" y="989"/><w x="-2126" y="989"/><w x="-2126" y="989"/><w x="-2126" y="1034"/><w x="-2126" y="1044"/></l><Note x="-2646" y="-258" width="234" height="439"><Text><![CDATA[From ts33.203 Annex IKey expansion functions for IPsec ESPIntegrity Keys:If the selected authentication algorithm is HMAC-MD5-96 then IKESP = IKIM.If the selected authentication algorithm is HMAC-SHA-1-96 then IKESP is obtained from IKIM by appending 32 zerobits to the end of IKIM to create a 160-bit string.Encryption Keys:Divide CKIM into two blocks of 64 bits each:CKIM = CKIM1 || CKIM2Where CK_IM1 are the 64 most significant bits and CK_IM2 are the 64 least significant bits.The key for DES-EDE3-CBC is then defined to be:CKESP = CKIM1 || CKIM2 || CKIM1,after adjusting parity bits to comply with RFC 2451 [20].If selected encryption algorithm is AES-CBC as specified in RFC 3602 [22] with 128 bit key then CKESP = CKIMFor hmac_sha_2_256 key derivation and header name are not in the spec therefore derivation is via appending 0 and alg name is set to hmac-sha-2-256]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="16" anchorIdType="1"><w x="-2397" y="-38"/><w x="-2102" y="-81"/></NoteLink></Note></layoutInformation></displayInformation><parameter xsi:type="CompoundParametersType"><ParameterAssignment xsi:type="ParameterAssignmentType"><ParameterName readOnly="true" xsi:type="VariableNameView">IPSEC_CipheringAlgorithm</ParameterName><ParameterValue default_able="true" variable_able="true" xsi:type="IPsec_CipheringAlgorithm_Type.type" variable_substituted="p_IPSEC_CipheringAlgorithm"><defaultValue><ConfigureIpSec xsi:type="ConfigureIpSec_RtdParameter.type"><SA_List><value-><elems-><value-><CipheringAlgorithm><variable->p_IPSEC_CipheringAlgorithm</variable-></CipheringAlgorithm></value-></elems-></value-></SA_List></ConfigureIpSec></defaultValue><nodePath>ConfigureIpSec/SA_List/value-/elems-/value-/CipheringAlgorithm</nodePath><procedureLibrary>ImsSignalingLib</procedureLibrary></ParameterValue></ParameterAssignment><ParameterAssignment xsi:type="ParameterAssignmentType"><ParameterName readOnly="true" xsi:type="VariableNameView">IPSEC_IntegrityAlgorithm</ParameterName><ParameterValue default_able="true" variable_able="true" xsi:type="IPsec_IntegrityAlgorithm_Type.type" variable_substituted="p_IPSEC_IntegrityAlgorithm"><defaultValue><ConfigureIpSec xsi:type="ConfigureIpSec_RtdParameter.type"><SA_List><value-><elems-><value-><IntegrityAlgorithm><variable->p_IPSEC_IntegrityAlgorithm</variable-></IntegrityAlgorithm></value-></elems-></value-></SA_List></ConfigureIpSec></defaultValue><nodePath>ConfigureIpSec/SA_List/value-/elems-/value-/IntegrityAlgorithm</nodePath><procedureLibrary>ImsSignalingLib</procedureLibrary></ParameterValue></ParameterAssignment><ParameterAssignment xsi:type="ParameterAssignmentType"><ParameterName readOnly="true" xsi:type="VariableNameView">NwSPI_C</ParameterName><ParameterValue default_able="true" variable_able="true" xsi:type="anonType:  i=-532 element, class com.anritsu.eu.rtd.engine.dom.schema.IntegerSchemaType ImsSignalingLib.TypeDefinitions.xsd" variable_substituted="vg_A_IMS_nwSecSPIc"><defaultValue><ConfigureIpSec xsi:type="ConfigureIpSec_RtdParameter.type"><SA_List><value-><elems-><value-><SPI><variable->vg_A_IMS_nwSecSPIc</variable-></SPI></value-></elems-></value-></SA_List></ConfigureIpSec></defaultValue><nodePath>ConfigureIpSec/SA_List/value-/elems-/value-/SPI</nodePath><procedureLibrary>ImsSignalingLib</procedureLibrary></ParameterValue></ParameterAssignment><ParameterAssignment xsi:type="ParameterAssignmentType"><ParameterName readOnly="true" xsi:type="VariableNameView">NwSPI_S</ParameterName><ParameterValue default_able="true" variable_able="true" xsi:type="anonType:  i