8" y="245"/><w x="-1968" y="245"/><w x="-1968" y="245"/><w x="-1968" y="266"/><w x="-1968" y="276"/></l><l o="7" a="9" s="false"><w x="-1967" y="413"/><w x="-1967" y="423"/><w x="-1967" y="425"/><w x="-1968" y="425"/><w x="-1968" y="425"/><w x="-1968" y="425"/><w x="-1968" y="451"/><w x="-1968" y="461"/></l><l o="36" a="22" s="false"><w x="-2067" y="-256"/><w x="-2067" y="-246"/><w x="-2067" y="-245"/><w x="-2069" y="-245"/><w x="-2069" y="-245"/><w x="-2069" y="-245"/><w x="-2069" y="-215"/><w x="-2069" y="-205"/></l><Note x="-2646" y="-261" width="234" height="374"><Text><![CDATA[From ts33.203 Annex I

Key expansion functions for IPsec ESP
Integrity Keys:
If the selected authentication algorithm is HMAC-MD5-96 then IKESP = IKIM.
If the selected authentication algorithm is HMAC-SHA-1-96 then IKESP is obtained from IKIM by appending 32 zero
bits to the end of IKIM to create a 160-bit string.
Encryption Keys:
Divide CKIM into two blocks of 64 bits each:
CKIM = CKIM1 || CKIM2
Where CK_IM1 are the 64 most significant bits and CK_IM2 are the 64 least significant bits.
The key for DES-EDE3-CBC is then defined to be:
CKESP = CKIM1 || CKIM2 || CKIM1,
after adjusting parity bits to comply with RFC 2451 [20].
If selected encryption algorithm is AES-CBC as specified in RFC 3602 [22] with 128 bit key then CKESP = CKIM]]></Text><NoteLink anchorId="16" anchorIdType="1"><w x="-2397" y="-74"/><w x="-2386" y="-74"/><w x="-2385" y="-74"/><w x="-2385" y="-85"/><w x="-2385" y="-85"/><w x="-2385" y="-85"/><w x="-2121" y="-85"/><w x="-2104" y="-85"/></NoteLink></Note></layoutInformation></displayInformation><parameter xsi:type="CompoundParametersType"><ParameterAssignment xsi:type="ParameterAssignmentType"><ParameterName readOnly="true" xsi:type="VariableNameView">IPSEC_CipheringAlgorithm</ParameterName><ParameterValue default_able="true" variable_able="true" xsi:type="IPsec_CipheringAlgorithm_Type.type" variable_substituted="p_IPSEC_CipheringAlgorithm"><defaultValue><ConfigureIpSec xsi:type="ConfigureIpSec_RtdParameter.type"><SA_List><value-><elems-><value-><CipheringAlgorithm><variable->p_IPSEC_CipheringAlgorithm</variable-></CipheringAlgorithm></value-></elems-></value-></SA_List></ConfigureIpSec></defaultValue><nodePath>ConfigureIpSec/SA_List/value-/elems-/value-/CipheringAlgorithm</nodePath><procedureLibrary>ImsSignalingLib</procedureLibrary></ParameterValue></ParameterAssignment><ParameterAssignment xsi:type="ParameterAssignmentType"><ParameterName readOnly="true" xsi:type="VariableNameView">IPSEC_IntegrityAlgorithm</ParameterName><ParameterValue default_able="true" variable_able="true" xsi:type="IPsec_IntegrityAlgorithm_Type.type" variable_substituted="p_IPSEC_IntegrityAlgorithm"><defaultValue><ConfigureIpSec xsi:type="ConfigureIpSec_RtdParameter.type"><SA_List><value-><elems-><value-><IntegrityAlgorithm><variable->p_IPSEC_IntegrityAlgorithm</variable-></IntegrityAlgorithm></value-></elems-></value-></SA_List></ConfigureIpSec></defaultValue><nodePath>ConfigureIpSec/SA_List/value-/elems-/value-/IntegrityAlgorithm</nodePath><procedureLibrary>ImsSignalingLib</procedureLibrary></ParameterValue></ParameterAssignment><ParameterAssignment xsi:type="ParameterAssignmentType"><Paramete